sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant App as Client App
    participant S as Server

    U->>App: Click Login

    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
    Note over App,S: Commit
    App->>S: GET /parameters
    S->>App: 200 { P, G }
    Note over App: R = random in [1, Q-1]
    App->>App: 
    Note over App: T = G^R mod P
    App->>App: 
    App->>S: POST /login/commit  { client_id, commitment_t: T }
    Note over S: session_id = CSPRNG token
    S->>S: 
    Note over S: binding = H( peer_addr | UA | session_id | client_id | T )
    S->>S: 
    Note over S: C = int(binding) mod Q
    S->>S: 
    Note over S: store { T, C, binding, session_id }
    S->>S: 
    S->>App: 200 { session_id, redirect_url: /login/verify-page?session_id=session_id }
    Note over App: display R to user on screen
    App->>App: 
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
    Note over U,App: Out-of-band handoff  (R travels via user, not network)
    App->>U: show R on screen
    U->>U: copy R
    App->>S: redirect browser to redirect_url with session_id
    end

    rect rgb(244, 242, 245)
    Note over U,S: Verify  (server-rendered page)
    S->>U: render form  where C and Q hardcoded in page
    U->>U: Enter client_id, password, and R
    Note over U: X = derive(password, client_id) mod Q
    U->>U: 
    Note over U: S_val = (R + C * X) mod Q  — computed in browser JS
    U->>U: 
    U->>S: POST /login/verify  { client_id, solution_s: S_val }<br/>X-Auth-Session: session_id
    Note over S: G^s == T * y^c  (mod P)
    S->>S: 
    S->>App: 200 { JWT }
    end